al language documents. Here a similar attempt at solving the problem has been performed, where part of a article from Wikipedia has been used as corpus and was tested against different type of questions that the program can answer correctly. Advanced QA requires sophisticated text processing tools based on state-of-the-art NLP.","topics":[],"score":2308,"global_rank":114138},{"name":"TobiasWooldridge/revive-survive","owner":"TobiasWooldridge","html_url":"https://github.com/TobiasWooldridge/revive-survive","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"App for #Govhack 2014 (#Unleashed)","topics":[],"score":2308,"global_rank":114140},{"name":"ryanvickr/Binary-Search-Tree","owner":"ryanvickr","html_url":"https://github.com/ryanvickr/Binary-Search-Tree","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"A simple application which scans a data file and stores it in a custom-built binary search tree.","topics":["binary-search-tree"],"score":2308,"global_rank":114144},{"name":"camerongineer/Chuck_Norris_Cipher_Encoder_Java","owner":"camerongineer","html_url":"https://github.com/camerongineer/Chuck_Norris_Cipher_Encoder_Java","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"Chuck Norris Cipher Encoder written in Java","topics":[],"score":2308,"global_rank":114191},{"name":"bansalhimanshu0296/himanshu-pet-clinic","owner":"bansalhimanshu0296","html_url":"https://github.com/bansalhimanshu0296/himanshu-pet-clinic","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":8,"language":"Java","description":"Himanshu Pet Clinic","topics":[],"score":2308,"global_rank":114206},{"name":"IamNicoleDenise/DecisionStructures","owner":"IamNicoleDenise","html_url":"https://github.com/IamNicoleDenise/DecisionStructures","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2308,"global_rank":114244},{"name":"IamNicoleDenise/SalaryCaculator","owner":"IamNicoleDenise","html_url"